id: chaos-twice-mark
name: Chaos Doubled
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
combatCondition: no
source: Pure Form
description: >
  Unpredictable (6): your Damage Attribute an additional time for all of your Attacking Maneuvers till the end of the Combat Round.
text: >
  (6)-[Triggered/Start of Combat Round]: Spend 3 stacks of Channeled Chaos. Until the end of this Combat Round, apply your Damage Attribute an additional time for all of your Attacking Maneuvers.

---

[passive]
damageAttribute.times += 1;
